              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacob called for his sons and said, “Gather round, and I will tell you what will happen to you in the future:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the twelve tribes of Israel, and this is what their father said as he spoke a suitable word of farewell to each son.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jacob commanded his sons, “Now that I am going to join my people in death, bury me with my fathers in the cave that is in the field of Ephron the Hittite, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.23.3+GEN.23.4+GEN.23.5+GEN.23.6+GEN.23.7+GEN.23.8+GEN.23.9+GEN.23.10+GEN.23.11+GEN.23.12+GEN.23.13+GEN.23.14+GEN.23.15+GEN.23.16+GEN.23.17+GEN.23.18+GEN.23.19+GEN.23.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 23.3–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at Machpelah, east of Mamre, in the land of Canaan. Abraham bought this cave and field from Ephron for a burial ground. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.9+GEN.25.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 25.9–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That is where they buried Abraham and his wife Sarah; that is where they buried Isaac and his wife Rebecca; and that is where I buried Leah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The field and the cave in it were bought from the Hittites. Bury me there.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jacob had finished giving instructions to his sons, he lay down again and died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.33"
            ]
          }
        }
